        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.poster.avif?t=1773150659\" width=620 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.webm?t=1773150659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.mp4?t=1773150659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aixin: Goddess’ Love is a short visual novel about the intertwined destinies of a goddess and a warrior in a world inspired by ancient Chinese mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aixin</strong></i> is a young goddess whose purity and virtue seem boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wen Yang</strong></i> is a seasoned warrior whose past has left him deeply scarred. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected event becomes a test, forcing both to doubt eternal truths. What is stronger: duty or feeling? Can love atone for sins? And what will remain when all principles collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/215fbfde8f6b16fa0c806e691a91bcc2.avif?t=1773150659\" width=620 height=113 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story (6800 words). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One decisive choice that determines the ending. Two alternative endings. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve tried to create a charming audiovisual atmosphere that will highlight the drama of this story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
